  "content": "\n\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ApexStudios-Dev/.github/refs/heads/master/assets/minecraft/fantasyfurniture_necrolord/banner.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"545\" height=\"118\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>Necrolord</strong> 家具套裝，專為 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fantasys-furniture\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Fantasy's Furniture</strong></a> 打造，新增具備完整功能的家具，包含但不限於：<strong>箱子</strong>、<strong>抽屜</strong>、<strong>床</strong>、<strong>座椅</strong> 以及更多！</p>\n<p>本家具套裝的設計深受 <strong>World Of Warcraft</strong> <strong>Shadowlands</strong> 資料片中 <strong>Necrolord</strong> 盟約的啟發。</p>\n<h3>製作配方</h3>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>要製作 <strong>Necrolord 磚塊</strong>／<strong>Necrolord 羊毛</strong>，您必須將 <strong>#minecraft:stone_crafting_materials</strong>／<strong>#minecraft:wool</strong> 作為輸入材料。</p>\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ApexStudios-Dev/.github/refs/heads/master/assets/minecraft/fantasyfurniture_necrolord/stonecutter_bricks.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ApexStudios-Dev/.github/refs/heads/master/assets/minecraft/fantasyfurniture_necrolord/stonecutter_wool.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>要製作 <strong>Necrolord</strong> 家具方塊，您必須將 <strong>#fantasyfurniture:binding_agent</strong>、<strong>Necrolord 磚塊</strong> 與 <strong>Necrolord 羊毛</strong> 放入 <strong>Furniture Station</strong> 中。</p>\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ApexStudios-Dev/.github/refs/heads/master/assets/minecraft/fantasyfurniture_necrolord/furniture_station.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n</div>\n<hr>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.apexmodder.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">歡迎加入我們的 <strong>Discord</strong></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.apexmodder.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"float:left\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ApexStudios-Dev/.github/refs/heads/master/assets/third_party/discord_banner.svg\" alt=\"\" width=\"174\" height=\"59\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fapexstudios\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/partners/custom-banners/f4d8198a-6c2a-4d86-8d74-1977589e8ef7.webp\" alt=\"\"></a></p>",
